sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Visa TAP failure: replayed nonce
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: Visa TAP failure: replayed nonce. 3 participants: AI agent, Site Protection Provider (CDN), and Merchant. 4 steps, 3 crossing a trust boundary, 2 failure branches. Based on visa-tap TAP spec, unversioned (read 2026-10-11) (2025-10-14). Step 1: AI agent to Site Protection Provider (CDN): Original signed request. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 2: Site Protection Provider (CDN) to Merchant: Verified and recorded. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 3: AI agent to Site Protection Provider (CDN): Same request replayed within 8 minutes. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 4: Site Protection Provider (CDN) to Site Protection Provider (CDN): Nonce lookup. If Nonce found: Block as replay. If Verifier keeps no nonce record: Replay is accepted TAP makes the record optional.
  autonumber
  participant p_agent as AI agent
  participant p_cdn as Site Protection Provider (CDN)
  participant p_merchant as Merchant
  p_agent->>p_cdn: Original signed request
  Note over p_agent,p_cdn: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_cdn->>p_merchant: Verified and recorded
  Note over p_cdn,p_merchant: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_agent->>p_cdn: Same request replayed within 8 minutes
  Note over p_agent,p_cdn: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_cdn->>p_cdn: Nonce lookup
  else Nonce found
    Note over p_cdn: Block as replay
  else Verifier keeps no nonce record
    Note over p_cdn: Replay is accepted#59; TAP makes the record optional
  end
